{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>澎湃榴槤味!奶油般香滑榴槤果蓉</p><p>Lady M全新貓山皇榴槤千層蛋糕</p><p>各位榴槤控終於等到了！Lady M 首度推出大家期盼已久的季節限定「貓山皇榴槤千層蛋糕」。嚴選馬來西亞果園直送、百分百樹上熟成自然掉落的極品貓山皇，濃郁的貓山皇榴槤肉配上鮮忌廉，加上超過二十層透薄如紙的班戟皮，入口綿密細滑！</p><p>純貓山皇榴槤果蓉！</p><p>蛋糕表面舖滿厚厚的純貓山皇榴槤果蓉，每啖都是貓山皇獨有的微苦同酒香餘韻，面層仲點綴了耀眼的食用金箔，視覺同味覺都好華麗！「貓山皇榴槤千層蛋糕」將由7月20日起，於Lady M 全線分店限量供應，各位榴槤迷切勿錯過！</p><p>Lady M 備註：「貓山皇榴槤千層蛋糕」將由 2026 年 7 月 20 日起，於 Lady M 香港及澳門全線分店限量供應;原個蛋糕亦將於同日起接受預訂，最快可於 7 月 27 日起取貨。</p><p>價錢：件裝$120 、6 吋原個蛋糕$820 、9 吋原個蛋糕$1200 官方網站: http://www.ladymhk.com/ 官方IG：@ladymhk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418162840197441_21308393296a58737da51f3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418163161872048_763246046a587380073aa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418163351390528_17270687236a58738234109.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418163565753928_21292361146a58738422744.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418163823492322_5023541666a5873870191f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418164033433070_20431515206a587388b54d1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178418164204364687_3747527816a58738a80218.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T06:22:10.268998+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":515,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}